		{"kind":"string","file":"src/modes/utils/hotkeys-markdown.ts","en":"| Hold `Space` | Speech-to-text (push-to-talk): hold to record, release to transcribe |","zh":"| 按住 `Space` | 语音转文字(按住说话):按住录音,松开转写 |"},
		{"kind":"template","file":"src/modes/utils/hotkeys-markdown.ts","en":"| \\`${appKey(bindings, \"app.live.toggle\")}\\` | Start/stop live voice mode (/live) |","zh":"| \\`${appKey(bindings, \"app.live.toggle\")}\\` | 开始/停止实时语音模式(/live) |"},
		{"kind":"template","file":"src/modes/utils/hotkeys-markdown.ts","en":"| \\`${appKey(bindings, \"app.agents.hub\")}\\` / \\`${appKey(bindings, \"app.session.observe\")}\\` / double-tap \\`←\\` (empty editor) | Open the agent hub |","zh":"| \\`${appKey(bindings, \"app.agents.hub\")}\\` / \\`${appKey(bindings, \"app.session.observe\")}\\` / 双击 \\`←\\`(空编辑器) | 打开代理中心 |"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/modes/utils/hotkeys-markdown.ts","en":"| `#<number>` | GitHub issue/PR reference (e.g. `#3164` → `pr://`/`issue://`) |","zh":"| `#<数字>` | GitHub issue/PR 引用(如 `#3164` → `pr://`/`issue://`) |"},
		{"kind":"string","file":"src/modes/utils/hotkeys-markdown.ts","en":"| `#` / `#<text>` | Prompt actions (copy / undo / move cursor) |","zh":"| `#` / `#<文本>` | 提示词操作(复制 / 撤销 / 移动光标) |"},
